uous-will-have-been--v-ing","content/tenses/04-future.md#future-perfect-simple-will-have--v3","content/tenses/04-future.md#future-continuous-will-be--v-ing","content/tenses/04-future.md#present-continuous-для-будущего","content/tenses/04-future.md#future-time-clauses"]},{"id":"adv-cloze-002-b6","answer":"arrive","accepted_answers":["arrive"],"rule_refs":["content/tenses/04-future.md#present-simple-для-будущего","content/tenses/04-future.md#future-perfect-continuous-will-have-been--v-ing","content/tenses/04-future.md#future-perfect-simple-will-have--v3","content/tenses/04-future.md#future-continuous-will-be--v-ing","content/tenses/04-future.md#present-continuous-для-будущего","content/tenses/04-future.md#future-time-clauses"]},{"id":"adv-cloze-002-b7","answer":"will give","accepted_answers":["will give"],"rule_refs":["content/tenses/04-future.md#present-simple-для-будущего","content/tenses/04-future.md#future-perfect-continuous-will-have-been--v-ing","content/tenses/04-future.md#future-perfect-simple-will-have--v3","content/tenses/04-future.md#future-continuous-will-be--v-ing","content/tenses/04-future.md#present-continuous-для-будущего","content/tenses/04-future.md#future-time-clauses"]},{"id":"adv-cloze-002-b8","answer":"will transform","accepted_answers":["will transform"],"rule_refs":["content/tenses/04-future.md#present-simple-для-будущего","content/tenses/04-future.md#future-perfect-continuous-will-have-been--v-ing","content/tenses/04-future.md#future-perfect-simple-will-have--v3","content/tenses/04-future.md#future-continuous-will-be--v-ing","content/tenses/04-future.md#present-continuous-для-будущего","content/tenses/04-future.md#future-time-clauses"]}]},{"id":"adv-cloze-003","type":"context_cloze","prompt":"I {{1:search}} the municipal archive for weeks when I finally found the missing register. At first I thought someone {{2:remove}} the relevant pages, because the numbering {{3:jump}} from 184 to 197. Then the archivist {{4:notice}} a second volume that nobody {{5:catalogue}}. We {{6:open}} it, and there the entries were. Only later {{7:I/realise}} that several historians {{8:look}} in the wrong collection for decades.","answer":["had been searching","had removed","jumped","noticed","had catalogued","opened","did I realise","had been looking"],"explanation_ru":"Связный рассказ переключается между основной линией Past Simple, более ранними процессами и результатами, а также инверсией после Only later.","rule_refs":["content/tenses/03-past.md#past-perfect-continuous","content/tenses/03-past.md#past-perfect-simple","content/tenses/03-past.md#past-simple","content/tenses/05-contrasts-and-pitfalls.md#18-маркированные-и-продвинутые-употребления","content/tenses/03-past.md#повествовательная-схема"],"cefr_estimate":"C2","title":"The archival discovery","blanks":[{"id":"adv-cloze-003-b1","answer":"had been searching","accepted_answers":["had been searching"],"rule_refs":["content/tenses/03-past.md#past-perfect-continuous","content/tenses/03-past.md#past-perfect-simple","content/tenses/03-past.md#past-simple","content/tenses/05-contrasts-and-pitfalls.md#18-маркированные-и-продвинутые-употребления","content/tenses/03-past.md#повествовательная-схема"]},{"id":"adv-cloze-003-b2","answer":"had removed","accepted_answers":["had removed"],"rule_refs":["content/tenses/03-past.md#past-perfect-continuous","content/tenses/03-past.md#past-perfect-simple","content/tenses/03-past.md#past-simple","content/tenses/05-contrasts-and-pitfalls.md#18-маркированные-и-продвинутые-употребления","content/tenses/03-past.md#повествовательная-схема"]},{"id":"adv-cloze-003-b3","answer":"jumped","accepted_answers":["jumped"],"rule_refs":["content/tenses/03-past.md#past-perfect-continuous","content/tenses/03-past.md#past-perfect-simple","content/tenses/03-past.md#past-simple","content/tenses/05-contrasts-and-pitfalls.md#18-маркированные-и-продвинутые-употребления","content/tenses/03-past.md#повествовательная-схема"]},{"id":"adv-cloze-003-b4","answer":"notice